# gates/battery.env.example — the RIG file template.  Copy to local/battery.env (gitignored) on every
# machine that runs gates (the driving workstation AND each GPU box's mirror tree) and fill in your
# values.  gates/lib/env.sh loads it; a gate that needs a key you left empty fails by name at that line.
#
# The two GPU boxes are called .33 (primary: builds, units, most servers) and .15 (second box: cross-box
# verification, box-side drivers) after the reference rig; keep the key names, change the values.
# Keys ending in _LAN are how the OTHER box reaches a box (the orchestrator's BOX-SIDE DRIVER law: a
# driver that ssh-es its server runs on the other box, and workstation ssh aliases do not resolve there).
# Values are plain shell assignments; quote only values with spaces.

# ---- hosts: ssh names usable from THIS machine (aliases from ~/.ssh/config are fine) ----
DS4_BOX33=gb10-a
DS4_BOX15=gb10-b
DS4_BOX33_LAN=user@10.0.0.33
DS4_BOX15_LAN=user@10.0.0.15

# ---- trees on the boxes (the rsync mirror of this checkout; the same path on both boxes) ----
DS4_BOX_TREE=/home/user/code/ds4
# DS4_BOX15_TREE=                        # only if .15 keeps its mirror elsewhere (default: DS4_BOX_TREE)
DS4_BOX_SCRATCH=/home/user               # where box-side legs and battery chains write their run dirs
# DS4_BOX_TREE_B=/home/user/code/ds4-baseline   # a baseline build for the A/B perf legs (perf/batched_lane_abba.sh)

# ---- models on the boxes ----
DS4_GGUF_DIR=/home/user/gguf             # the launch-defaults catalog dir (base, MTP, DSpark drafters by name)
DS4_GGUF_VISION_DIR=/home/user/gguf-vision   # a catalog dir whose base symlinks resolve to the Vision base
DS4_TEXT_BASE=/home/user/gguf/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-IQ2XXS-w2Q2K-AProjQ8-SExpQ8-OutQ8-chat-v2-imatrix-0731.gguf
DS4_VISION_BASE=/home/user/gguf/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Exp-IQ2XXS-w2Q2K-AProjQ8-SExpQ8-OutQ8.gguf
DS4_VISION_ENCODER=/home/user/gguf/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-Vision-Encoder.gguf

# ---- oracles and external harnesses ----
DS4_ORACLE_TREE=/home/user/code/ds4-upstream-oracle   # upstream checkout at the pinned oracle commit (vision identity legs)
DS4_VISION_ORACLE_RUN=/home/user/vision_identity_oracle   # the recorded oracle identity run (prompt lengths for the API leg)
DS4_TEB_DIR=/home/user/code/tool-eval-bench           # tool-eval-bench checkout with its .venv (agent legs; lives on .15)

# ---- conventions (defaults in gates/lib/env.sh; set only to override) ----
# DS4_BOX_LOCK_DIR=/tmp/ds4_box_lock     # the box-ownership lock (nonce file) on each box
# DS4_CHAIN_REG=$HOME/.ds4_chains        # the chain registry the watchdogs read (on the driving workstation)
